\newlabel{fig:tier1}{{3}{7}{Tier~1 discovery data flow. An EventLog handle is checked against the FNV-1a columnar cache; on a miss the log is converted to a columnar view and inserted. The cached view feeds a single-pass scan that accumulates a follows map, applies the dependency measure and threshold filter, and stores the resulting DFG handle in \texttt {APP\_STATE}}{figure.caption.3}{}}
